flowchart TD
  read[read_draft核对当前状态] --> state{同文件存在授权pending?}
  state -->|是| pending[source=pending；返回ID和hash]
  pending --> edit[传当前ID/hash增量修改原卡]
  pending --> apply[用户可在生成中应用；记录apply_draft来源]
  apply --> reread[重新read_draft]
  reread --> state
  state -->|否| formal[source=applied；正式文件；无ID]
  formal --> old{edit仍传历史ID?}
  old -->|是| stale[DRAFT_ID_STALE；无写入；要求重读并省略ID]
  stale --> reread
  old -->|否| hash{最新hash及正式基线/资源锁匹配?}
  hash -->|否| conflict[VERSION_CONFLICT；不覆盖]
  hash -->|是| new[以当前正式文件为基线创建新pending卡]
  new --> read
